sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Sequência UML - Check-out, Quarto Sujo e Ciclo de Governança

    actor Receptionist as Recepcionista
    actor Housekeeper as Governança / Camareira
    participant MFE as Microfrontend React
    participant BFF as BFF NestJS
    participant APIM as API Gateway (APIM)
    participant Res as Reservas Service (SQL)
    participant Bus as Azure Service Bus
    participant Hotel as Hotel Service (Mongo)
    participant Mongo as MongoDB Atlas

    %% 1. Check-out
    Receptionist->>MFE: Realiza Check-out da Reserva #RES-501
    MFE->>BFF: POST /api/v1/reservations/RES-501/checkout
    BFF->>APIM: POST /api/v1/reservations/RES-501/checkout
    APIM->>Res: POST /internal/reservations/RES-501/checkout
    Note over Res: Transita reserva para 'COMPLETED', grava na Outbox
    Res-->>APIM: 200 OK
    APIM-->>BFF: 200 OK
    BFF-->>MFE: 200 OK (Check-out Concluído)
    Res->>Bus: Evento Assíncrono CheckOutCompleted (roomId: 'R201')

    %% 2. Transição automática para Sujo (Dirty)
    Bus->>Hotel: Consume CheckOutCompleted
    activate Hotel
    Hotel->>Mongo: updateOne({ id: 'R201' }, { $set: { status: 'dirty' } })
    Hotel->>Mongo: insertOne({ taskType: 'cleaning', roomId: 'R201', status: 'pending' })
    deactivate Hotel

    %% 3. Início da Limpeza pela Governança
    Housekeeper->>MFE: Seleciona Quarto 201 e clica "Iniciar Higienização"
    MFE->>BFF: PATCH /api/v1/housekeeping/rooms/R201/status { status: 'cleaning' }
    BFF->>APIM: PATCH /api/v1/housekeeping/rooms/R201/status
    APIM->>Hotel: PATCH /rooms/R201/cleaning-status
    activate Hotel
    Hotel->>Mongo: updateOne({ id: 'R201' }, { $set: { status: 'cleaning' } })
    Hotel-->>APIM: 200 OK { roomId: 'R201', status: 'cleaning' }
    deactivate Hotel
    APIM-->>BFF: 200 OK
    BFF-->>MFE: 200 OK (Status Em Limpeza)

    %% 4. Conclusão da Limpeza e Liberação
    Housekeeper->>MFE: Vistoria concluída -> clica "Liberar Quarto"
    MFE->>BFF: PATCH /api/v1/housekeeping/rooms/R201/status { status: 'available' }
    BFF->>APIM: PATCH /api/v1/housekeeping/rooms/R201/status
    APIM->>Hotel: PATCH /rooms/R201/cleaning-status
    activate Hotel
    Hotel->>Mongo: updateOne({ id: 'R201' }, { $set: { status: 'available' } })
    Hotel->>Bus: Publish RoomCleaningCompleted (roomId: 'R201', hotelId: 'H01')
    Hotel-->>APIM: 200 OK { roomId: 'R201', status: 'available' }
    deactivate Hotel
    APIM-->>BFF: 200 OK
    BFF-->>MFE: 200 OK (Quarto Pronto para Nova Hospedagem)
    MFE-->>Receptionist: Painel da Recepção atualiza Quarto 201 para Verde (Disponível)
